<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;GENEVA INTERNATIONAL FILM FESTIVAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Geneva International Film Festival (GIFF) is a film festival that has explored the relationship between cinema, television, and digital creation since 1995, focusing on the place of the author in the artistic process."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GUWAHATI INTERNATIONAL FILM FESTIVAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Guwahati International Film Festival (GIFF) is an annual film festival held in Guwahati, Assam, India, organized by the Jyoti Chitraban (Film Studio) Society in association with the Dr. Bhupen Hazarika Regional Government Film and Television Institute."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ASSAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Assam is a state in India where the Guwahati International Film Festival is held and where the Guwahati Tea Auction Centre is located."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GUWAHATI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Guwahati is the capital city of Assam, where the Guwahati International Film Festival is held and where the Guwahati Tea Auction Centre is located."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INDIAN TEA ASSOCIATION (ABITA)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Indian Tea Association (ABITA) is the headquarters of the Assam branch and is located in Guwahati, managing the Guwahati Tea Auction Centre."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GUWAHATI TEA AUCTION CENTRE (GTAC)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Guwahati Tea Auction Centre (GTAC) is the world's largest CTC tea auction centre and the second-largest in terms of total tea auctioned, located in Guwahati."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KAMAKHYA TEMPLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kamakhya Temple is an ancient temple in Guwahati mentioned in ancient puranas and epics, proving the city's existence in ancient times."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BASISTHA TEMPLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Basistha Temple is an ancient temple in Guwahati, existing since ancient times."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NAVAGRAHA TEMPLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Navagraha Temple is an ancient temple in Guwahati, existing since ancient times."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DISPUR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dispur is the capital complex in Guwahati where the Guwahati Tea Auction Centre is located."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AMBARI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ambari is the site of excavations that trace the existence of Guwahati in ancient times."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TEA ASSOCIATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tea Association refers to the Indian Tea Association (ABITA) which manages the Guwahati Tea Auction Centre."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TEA AUCTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tea Auction refers to the process of selling tea at the Guwahati Tea Auction Centre, which is the world's largest CTC tea auction centre."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OSCAR WINNING ‘THE SALESMAN’&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"‘The Salesman’ is an Oscar-winning film screened at the Guwahati International Film Festival."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. BHUPEN HAZARIKA REGIONAL GOVERNMENT FILM AND TELEVISION INSTITUTE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Bhupen Hazarika Regional Government Film and Television Institute is involved in organizing the Guwahati International Film Festival."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JYOTI CHITRABAN (FILM STUDIO) SOCIETY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jyoti Chitraban (Film Studio) Society organizes the Guwahati International Film Festival."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SARBANANDA SONOWAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sarbananda Sonowal is the Assam Chief Minister who inaugurated the first Guwahati International Film Festival."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ASGHAR FARHADI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Asghar Farhadi is the director of the Oscar-winning film ‘The Salesman’ which was screened at the Guwahati International Film Festival."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ASSAM GOVERNMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Assam Government supports the Guwahati International Film Festival."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHIEF MINISTER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chief Minister is a political role held by Sarbananda Sonowal, who inaugurated the first Guwahati International Film Festival."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;GENEVA INTERNATIONAL FILM FESTIVAL&quot;" target="&quot;GUWAHATI INTERNATIONAL FILM FESTIVAL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Both film festivals are named GIFF, though they are held in different locations, both focus on cinema, television, and digital creation."</data>
      <data key="d5">"film festival similarities, different locations"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GUWAHATI INTERNATIONAL FILM FESTIVAL&quot;" target="&quot;ASSAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Guwahati International Film Festival is held in Assam, highlighting the cultural and economic significance of the state."</data>
      <data key="d5">"cultural event, regional significance"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GUWAHATI INTERNATIONAL FILM FESTIVAL&quot;" target="&quot;GUWAHATI&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Guwahati International Film Festival is held in Guwahati, emphasizing the city's role in hosting such events."</data>
      <data key="d5">"city event, cultural hub"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GUWAHATI INTERNATIONAL FILM FESTIVAL&quot;" target="&quot;INDIAN TEA ASSOCIATION (ABITA)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Guwahati International Film Festival and the Indian Tea Association (ABITA) are both based in Guwahati, indicating the city's diverse industries and cultural events."</data>
      <data key="d5">"city diversity, cultural and economic significance"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GUWAHATI INTERNATIONAL FILM FESTIVAL&quot;" target="&quot;GUWAHATI TEA AUCTION CENTRE (GTAC)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Guwahati International Film Festival and the Guwahati Tea Auction Centre are both located in Guwahati, showcasing the city's economic and cultural activities."</data>
      <data key="d5">"city activities, cultural and economic significance"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GUWAHATI&quot;" target="&quot;KAMAKHYA TEMPLE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Kamakhya Temple is located in Guwahati, highlighting the city's rich historical and religious heritage."</data>
      <data key="d5">"historical and religious significance, city landmarks"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GUWAHATI&quot;" target="&quot;BASISTHA TEMPLE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Basistha Temple is located in Guwahati, contributing to the city's historical and religious significance."</data>
      <data key="d5">"historical and religious significance, city landmarks"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GUWAHATI&quot;" target="&quot;NAVAGRAHA TEMPLE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Navagraha Temple is located in Guwahati, adding to the city's historical and religious significance."</data>
      <data key="d5">"historical and religious significance, city landmarks"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0374-f5f32368bb91</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
